# D-Bus activation for rusty-board: the first `Show` call from tideshell's
# keyboard toggle starts the keyboard through systemd if it is not running.
# (KWin launches its keyboard itself, InputMethod= in kwinrc; cosmic-comp
# does not, which is why the FP5 log said "rusty-board not running".)
#   install -Dm644 io.rustyboard.Keyboard.service ~/.local/share/dbus-1/services/io.rustyboard.Keyboard.service
[D-BUS Service]
Name=io.rustyboard.Keyboard
Exec=/bin/false
SystemdService=rusty-board.service
